        reader check them.
      </li>
      <li>
        Names are transliterated from Russian, so the Latin spellings differ
        from other pages on this site (for example Samgug and Samkough, Marj and
        Mardj, Tarik Hagur and Hagur Tariq Mumtaz).
      </li>
      <li>
        The article is footnoted, but the footnotes are in a notes list I did not
